; One variable: SUB and MUL items inside an opaque SubViewport lower the alpha its target stores.
; Godot samples an opaque target's alpha as 1 (`swizzle_a = ONE`, `texture_storage.cpp:3641-3642`),
; so the container shows the viewport opaque over the yellow behind it.

